"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["13527"],"vndbCharacterId":"c146480"},"originalCharacterName":"ペンギン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious, smartly dressed penguin with the ability to understand and speak human language. However, it is painfully shy, so normally it pretends to be just a regular penguin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It works as a receptionist and bellhop at a hotel where the souls of the dead end up, so the younger residents of Maison sans Nom refer to it as \"God.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It has a huge attitude for a cute little penguin and is extremely hard to please. The best way to buy its favor is with sweets and snacks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146480"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"男子寮の寮長。オス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学食のコックでもある。しゃべらない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13527","sourceWorkId":"8076","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dce180521c8e7c5ca6b5cae5c40f688e425009b023b75046a9a2616ca07643a4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43011d7cd68098e45234e209a206d32f349962771c7354b4611bfe8c89c8bb30.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤沢 れい香","creatorId":"vndb:s14338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14338","name":"藤沢 れい香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99574","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c146471","characterName":"橘 才","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c146471"},"originalCharacterName":"橘 才","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"15"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the story: A ruthless boy who cannot feel pain in his heart. His younger sister, his only family, is the one person he treasures, and anyone who torments her is met with a brutal end by his hands... Yet, yearning to understand the human heart, he often interrogates his victims, even though they cannot respond."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Just as he begins to seek respite from his bleak life, his unexpected encounter with Benio Matsuri causes him to experience a kind of pain akin to love in his heart."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146471"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8da12eda2a05b1f0bf4501203f8e828e852366f3130f55f0316e7f74a1f2fde1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/15ccb9b8190aa36cc776e79798f89067dc6afa33beb5e3b68a90ea752eb6fad7.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花守 ゆみり","creatorId":"vndb:s14119","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14119","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14119","name":"花守 ゆみり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99573","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c146472","characterName":"紅緒 祀","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c146472"},"originalCharacterName":"紅緒 祀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl born into the Benio Family, a powerful family of Maledict Exorcists, who is tightly bound by her family's curse. Due to an incident in the past, causing her to close off her heart, she doesn't speak and barely shows any emotion. Her eyes remain closed at all times, as if she wishes to isolate herself from the cruel world she lives in. Since she only moves when someone pulls her along by the hand, her demeanor evokes the image of a beautifully crafted doll."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a Curse Bearer with the ability to give Maledicts form and use their powers freely."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146472"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d10add51bbadce54425863c6f021186d98111a551e2da4462220617184c29ab.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fdc9ad7a96ecbbcf0e4d8a2366f4b394efe33b1fcd8f82d77ccca557bc9e8abc.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石見 舞菜香","creatorId":"vndb:s17263","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17263","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17263","name":"石見 舞菜香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99575","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c146473","characterName":"ヒトデナシ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c146473"},"originalCharacterName":"ヒトデナシ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Another personality that dwells inside Benio Matsuri's heart that appears when Matsuri is asleep. Nobody sees herself as a shield that protects Matsuri from the cruel world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She can be incredibly selfish, and her words, actions, and strong attitude cause her to come across as a haughty, ill-mannered girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146473"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69d10787d8908e89c14961324c009ae40bf34595206fb3b73f8de111f21535f8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/951438d5821241749e232633985c4c2c33da851da8b13e34a131631db5e52417.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石見 舞菜香","creatorId":"vndb:s17263","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17263","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17263","name":"石見 舞菜香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99576","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c146474","characterName":"鎌原 竜起","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c146474"},"originalCharacterName":"鎌原 竜起","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An earnest and sincere boy who was born with a body that doesn't feel any physical pain. Despite the unjust world around him, he wishes to keep on the straight and narrow, even if no one else does."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He began training at a young age under a master who claimed to be invincible in order to become... well, a certain something. He has infiltrated the Benio Family and is biding his time for the chance to free Benio Matsuri, his first love, from their curse."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146474"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f07397b62bda706e9ffa1802f273090a8059b8a4f88d21d15db93056ea7ed6a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c3f91236ebdb4db944a943f22df4fbb4218fd4d6906f032768c41fbd7991c6ba.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"森嶋 秀太","creatorId":"vndb:s8382","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8382","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8382","name":"森嶋 秀太","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99572","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c146475","characterName":"塚原 碧","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c146475"},"originalCharacterName":"塚原 碧","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A seemingly cheerful and sociable resident of Maison sans Nom. She's especially close with her friend Ando Mémé. Born as a Curse Bearer, she works as one of the Benio Family's mercenaries and exorcists."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On top of her mischievous tendencies, she wants more than anything to be a housewife. Her cooking might not be up to par now, but she's working on it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146475"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c50789abd448e17e758261ff6a2f0039cccdd812867b45045a12e54962684401.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f93d142800f0693360355de6a59591ba6e863c65d51fc4725544f570b2400b93.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"咲々木 瞳","creatorId":"vndb:s41472","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s41472","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s41472","name":"咲々木瞳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99583","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c146476","characterName":"杏道 目々","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c146476"},"originalCharacterName":"杏道 目々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A surly resident of Maison sans Nom and a Curse Bearer like Ao. Despite her ambitious and hard-working nature, she tends to scare people off due to her prickly attitude."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she is keener than anyone when it comes to helping her friends, and Ao is especially reliant on her companionship. Her goal in life is to rake in the money as a top-grade exorcist."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146476"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cda0135a8a319bd568207a642a6733076deb879cfb20882051e84c27574f1e45.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f0bc7bfe722c597ea60f1cffcec27e74d55d4fe28c07dfd2ad7e9e51f8ebd23.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"月城 日花","creatorId":"vndb:s33295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s33295","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s33295","name":"月城 日花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99581","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c146477","characterName":"霧島 梅雨","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c146477"},"originalCharacterName":"霧島 梅雨","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The landlord of Maison sans Nom. Tsuyu is obsessed with his own cuteness and habitually declares himself the cutest person in the world. He enjoys teasing the other residents, and while they get annoyed with Tsuyu's antics sometimes, they still adore him. He often earns himself a spanking from Yozora."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is also a content creator who makes full use of his looks while livestreaming as \"Chuyu.\" He has a preference for strong-willed people and takes a particular liking to Tatsuki in this regard."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Curse Bearer like Ao and Mémé, he possesses a mysterious power."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146477"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae1adb75d99dc78ec5db3d13bf75e83773e4ee9597ebb25667a0c3409249aa38.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34e416b0d1e746832f4e0fa711bff05eb68e7f83024bb0dce793b7a81c2f3fc3.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"首藤 志奈","creatorId":"vndb:s20736","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20736","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20736","name":"首藤志奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99578","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c146478","characterName":"神鳥 夜空","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c146478"},"originalCharacterName":"神鳥 夜空","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"26"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"As the only grown-up resident of Maison sans Nom, Yozora acts as the guardian of the younger residents. She appears to be a beautiful, classy lady... until she opens her mouth. With her frank and outspoken attitude, as well as her tendency to drink cheap booze, gamble on horses, and \"borrow\" money from the kids without ever returning it, she's not exactly what one would consider a responsible adult."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yozora does not possess any Maledict powers, but she prides herself on being the strongest martial artist in the world."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146478"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71e2f1f762357201277393caaf049163aa212165034bf32ad94ed8035a573679.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/377669aa54f565f877124c7eba1305e61aa35b80d9bba93d3fea94733f92f06a.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空賀 花","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99577","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c146479","characterName":"紅緒 終","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c146479"},"originalCharacterName":"紅緒 終","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The current head of the Benio Family and Matsuri's younger sister. Contrary to her appearance as a young girl, she considers herself the matriarch of the family, referring to all its members as her \"children,\" regardless of blood relations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Inside her heart dwells three different personalities, each with their own quirks and caprices. All are cold, cruel, and ruthless by nature, although she sometimes displays a child-like innocence befitting her age."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c146479"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee66df051712b159279b8ef44d600f4cb10758e85a98f9f504d156aea16968af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c718d08ee10e33818b1bda989e38f5df1598e7a0f504fbbeaacaa626d8e55f01.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中 貴子","creatorId":"vndb:s29188","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29188","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29188","name":"田中 貴子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99580","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c153714","characterName":"敷島 四季","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c153714"},"originalCharacterName":"敷島 四季","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Matsuri's mother. Even after becoming a Maledict, she stays by Matsuri's side and continues watching over her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the past, she kidnapped a baby from the Benio Residence and raised it at Maison sans Nom."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c153714"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e7fe7a72113ecff7948ae6d4411008eac3f4f3ed6b9a61f946af57b0572b492.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4ba79e44a237122986538278f7c2507e5802a33f4b6d06338ac966f02d24a1a6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"関根 明良","creatorId":"vndb:s23420","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23420","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23420","name":"関根明良","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99579","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c153715","characterName":"アンドウ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c153715"},"originalCharact